	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "2x20 2.54 mm male header (JLC C50980) for a 40-way ribbon to a Raspberry Pi. Pads are 1.4 mm rather than the vendor's 1.6 so the pin field can be routed out of; the 1.0 mm drill still leaves a 0.2 mm annular ring. Numbering is the vendor's own, straight through - NOT the swapped numbering of the socket this replaced, because a ribbon maps pin n to pin n. The same holes take a shrouded DC3-40P box header, which is keyed; the board keeps its shroud footprint clear.")
